 result←object(State Seg)arg;tunits;props;points
 result←⍬
 ⍝ 'Seg' (n m ⍴ r c r c ...) (r c r c ...) ...

 '∆WI RANK ERROR: Seg'##.Error∨/2<≢¨⍴¨arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Seg'##.Error∨/2|⊢/¨⍴¨arg
 'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error∨/1<|≡¨arg
 arg←⊃,/,¨↓¨arg ⍝ If any items are matrices, split them into individual lines so we can process them sequentially
 arg←arg/⍨##.IsNum¨arg ⍝ For some reason, scalar text is not an error, so we'll just ignore it

 tunits←⊃##.Classes._supp.MyUnits State
 props←StartObj'Poly'
 props,←DefinePen State
 props,←⊂'DrawMode'(2⊃State._mode)

 :For points :In arg ⍝ Build one unconnected set of lines at a time
     points←tunits×⍤1{⍵⍴⍨2,⍨2÷⍨≢⍵}points ⍝ Convert to pixels from object's scale and re-form into 2-column matrix
     State GUI props,⊂'Points'points
 :EndFor
